00:59:53.640 --> 01:00:22.430
<v Chana Joffe-Walk>Our managing editor is Sarah Abdurrahman. Our senior editor is David Kestenbaum. Special thanks today to Abraham Oleksnianski, Marianne McCune, Jessica Mendoza, Brooke Yarbrough, Juan "Punchy" Gonzalez, Paige Duggins-Clay, Erin Einhorn, David Riedman, Amy Klinger, Andrew Hairston, Russell Skiba, and Alaa Mustafa. Our website-- thisamericanlife.org, where you can stream our archive of over 700 episodes for absolutely free.
