01:00:22.430 --> 01:00:42.990
<v Chana Joffe-Walk>This American Life is delivered to public radio stations by PRX, the Public Radio Exchange. Thanks, as always, to my boss, Ira Glass. Did you guys know that Ira's known me since I was a baby? I asked him recently if he knew way back when that one day, I would host his radio show. He said he was sure it would never happen.
<v Chana Joffe-Walk>《美国生活》由PRX（公共广播交易所）分发给公共广播电台。一如既往，感谢我的老板Ira Glass。你们知道吗，Ira从我婴儿时期就认识我了。我最近问他，他当年是否知道有一天我会主持他的广播节目。他说他确信那绝不会发生。

01:00:42.990 --> 01:00:47.910
<v Jacob>Like, even though, as a baby, I knew you were a flawed person, I just didn't expect that from you.
<v Jacob>就像，尽管作为一个婴儿时我就知道你有瑕疵，但我确实没想到你会那样。

01:00:47.910 --> 01:00:52.910
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>Well, here I am. I'm Chana Joffe-Walt. Ira will be back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>好吧，我在这儿。我是Chana Joffe-Walt。Ira下周会回来，带来更多《美国生活》的故事。
